    {
      "sectionId": "section-feats-and-ability-score-increases",
      "parentSectionId": "section-example",
      "heading": "Feats and Ability Score Increases",
      "sourceAnchor": "feats-and-ability-score-increases",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-feats-and-ability-score-increases-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At level 1 we get Tough from our Background."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-feats-and-ability-score-increases-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At level 4 we’ll take Shield Master"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-feats-and-ability-score-increases-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At level 6 we’ll take Polearm Master."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-feats-and-ability-score-increases-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At level 8 we’ll take Sentinel."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-levels",
      "parentSectionId": "section-example",
      "heading": "Levels",
      "sourceAnchor": "levels",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-levels-1",
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Level"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Feat(s) and Features"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Notes and Tactics"
              }
            ]
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Fighting Style:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "– Protection"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Second Wind"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Weapon Mastery:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "– Quarterstaff"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "– Any"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "– Any"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Wear armor and a shield, have 18 AC and bonk things on the head. Sometimes they fall over."
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "From our Species ability Hill’s Tumble, we get the ability to guarantee that trip against something Large or smaller twice a day (which will scale)."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Action Surge"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Tactical Mind"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Once you Prone something scary, Action Surge for more attacks to finish it off."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Fighter Subclass: Battle Master"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "We grab Trip Attack, Parry, Riposte, and some other stuff that doesn’t matter."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Feat: Shield Master"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Now, between Topple on Attack, Topple on Riposte, Trip Attack, and Shield Master, we have 4 ways of making things Prone in one round without resorting to unarmed strikes. Eventually something will fail a save."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Extra Attack"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Tactical Shift"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Now it’s 5 saves per round."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Feat: Polearm Master"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Now it’s 6 saves per round thanks to Pole Strike. Nothing should be upright near you for very long."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "7"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Know Your Enemy"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Sure."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "8"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Feat: Sentinel"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Now we have 20 Strength, Reaction triggers out the wazoo, and every available tool for making things Prone I can think of that isn’t a class feature. If your Shield Master save works, DPR is 28.13 assuming they stay Prone through all of your attacks including your Reaction, putting us 75% above Target DPR. If we’d taken Dueling instead of Protection, we’d be at 34.69 instead, nicely about 10% over High DPR."
                }
              ]
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
